<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-30T16:06:18.086Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:06:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a Plateau community, killing four civilians despite a curfew, and later burned a vigilante office and arrested two suspects. In Ekiti, Sowore was attacked and accused police of downplaying the incident, while another report says he was abducted there. A police inspector and 11 civilians were killed in terror attacks on villages, and troops killed one soldier and 48 ISWAP fighters in Borno and Yobe. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQi1qVHBZSnZUdUU5NjJGVkd5RGJIZmlfbjJFQ0dSTE1BYk1SOXo2S2xOZTZyUWRnVWtkNmthZnZiemxHTEM1RGpNZjVkcGE0elhPSDBBcElhR2dubWdtcjhKMVk2ZjJmdXVvS1pwMENPU1B5ZnN3QzB6a2FrOUdOYlJoUFZlc0QwdDJsOW1uNmNGLUQ2R0ZSU0Vyd0d4bHkybmRIck9kZnRmOWRqVTJSbFBLRHd5Ri1fVmFQc2xB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNbThGcFBORkZjeWpZWm9sNmx1UjFlQU9kZWNGbzdwOHVYdmtySjc0b2hHekZtV1ZGQ0g5STE0aktRRXJaSUd0Qkl1RWw2MUdoM084bmh4QzREeG5Xa1dPUm1QNENVbFdHUHo5NUN1VHVLa0NpMXhfUWdQTHBOei1HR2RUcTFWZEE1U0EtSVpxWXYxM2hHZHBVREw5UThza050UVZWc1gyelhrQlRkZDlETXowMzNsRjNrNEctZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNMFhMa01FSzF2eVA5RVpLNndoNDNzSTJGc0dRNlJwU3RSMHI0SXRLcjhSNEh4N0gxRGZRWEhJOWUtTXlfbm85Qmktcy1jS3VDLTJsNTFoc2FMbUNEeFVrWlRkdUM3c0RrczcybU1FclYzX1NkSm1qUm1Da2FfTEl3dGpqRVU2ekwzUkg3a0Z2cklRdmZFNTVjVmRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNd3gxbF9yaG84OTdqLTBaOWdqbzNKT1JBbFQ5VEI3VHdSX0JoRVdoYkVlMTBTcFBXYktsMTVQcDkyN25ueUJMX1BhcWpZRUpwWmVzSDdxT04tcWdITmhRVFVIZEpLa2RSUlZteWd2NFVhMU9Sd2F5MHNtSDgwVTlCcFRqcjJyRWgzTnQ0aHZlQlcyZ0w3T3V5Sm1memdlSnZraGVjYU1Fbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeri